{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/173926ca5ca68be6352e07e55f7f5353.poster.avif?t=1761246156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/173926ca5ca68be6352e07e55f7f5353.webm?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/173926ca5ca68be6352e07e55f7f5353.mp4?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the soft morning light of your own countryside plot, where the earth feels kind beneath your boots and the wind carries the gentle hum of life. In Farmers Market, you\u2019ll cultivate more than crops\u2014you\u2019ll build a home, find rhythm in the seasons, and feel the heartbeat of a living economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your farm your way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange plots with care, pick your favourite seeds, and listen to the crunch of wheelbarrows and the whisper of leaves. Every harvest feels like a little triumph\u2014and cozy in its own right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a13c30546d39544948790a36824f93a9.poster.avif?t=1761246156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a13c30546d39544948790a36824f93a9.webm?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a13c30546d39544948790a36824f93a9.mp4?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade like a market-veteran</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crop prices sway like a heartbeat: buy low, sell high, hedge against risk, and watch as your small farm grows into a bustling little empire. Yet the world remains gentle: even when the marketplace stirs, you\u2019re still on your home patch, listening to birds and tending your roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/ee3238eae1d0b0b383158e6ff64d3b80.poster.avif?t=1761246156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/ee3238eae1d0b0b383158e6ff64d3b80.webm?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/ee3238eae1d0b0b383158e6ff64d3b80.mp4?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather the seasons\u2014and the surprises</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pests, weeds, and the odd market shock might ripple across your fields, but your cosy farm is your anchor. Automate, upgrade, expand\u2014and let the ambient soundtrack wrap you in a calm shell while you manage your little economic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/7244546bc0099e7ef4fe3774a778c24f.poster.avif?t=1761246156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/7244546bc0099e7ef4fe3774a778c24f.webm?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/7244546bc0099e7ef4fe3774a778c24f.mp4?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/e8f06f621f790e8aa76d38509e30eb60.poster.avif?t=1761246156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/e8f06f621f790e8aa76d38509e30eb60.webm?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/e8f06f621f790e8aa76d38509e30eb60.mp4?t=1761246156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re planting your first row or timing your tenth sale, Farmers Market invites you to slow down, build steadily, and find joy in both the soil and the spreadsheet. Cozy visuals, soft sounds, big strategy\u2014your market adventure awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Farmers Market</i> and be ready when the market opens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930640?t=1761246156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/0266254f39355af166792b453bbf476cb655ef96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761246156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/3ed5fb842dd41d0c5214d99f1d54cfff6a48d453/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761246156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/3ed5fb842dd41d0c5214d99f1d54cfff6a48d453/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761246156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl